  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Credit and Financial Services: Rural Enterprise Acceleration Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of REAP is to contribute to doubling the incomes of rural households and reduce distress migration from rural areas. The development objective is to build resilience in rural households by diversifying their sources of income through intensified, cluster-based, climate-resilient production systems from selected value chains. Also aimed for is the promotion of on- and off-farm enterprises and the development of a supportive ecosystem. Farm enterprise intensification will be achieved through support to community groups and their federated structures to promote cluster-based production through apposite value chains, based on market demand.</narrative>
  </description>
